# Task 5 — Resource Transfer & Assignment

Allow authorized users to move employees between projects.

### Transfer Flow

```text
Select Employee
      ↓
Select Target Project
      ↓
Validate Permissions
      ↓
Validate Project Capacity
      ↓
Validate Employee Assignment
      ↓
Confirm Transfer
      ↓
Update Resource Assignment
      ↓
Create Notification
      ↓
Record Transfer History
```

### After Transfer

* Remove the employee's access to the old project.
* Grant access to the new project.
* Update their active project.
* Ensure all project-based APIs use the new assignment.
* On the employee's next login, display a clear notification explaining the project change.
* The employee must **never be able to access or see the old project** after the transfer.
* Preserve transfer history for authorized administrators/managers.

