# Task 14 — Project Customization

Allow Admins/Managers to customize project appearance and metadata.

### 14.1 Project Icon

On the Project Information/Edit page:

* Add an option to change the project icon.
* Use a pre-existing icon library.
* Provide **100+ icons**.
* Add icon search functionality.
* Allow users to search by relevant terms.

Example:

```text
Search: "database"

Results:
Database
Server
Storage
Cloud
...
```

Do not implement a custom icon-search engine.

### 14.2 Project Color

Allow authorized users to:

* Select a project color.
* Preview the color.
* Use the selected color consistently throughout the project UI.

### 14.3 Permissions

Only authorized roles such as:

* Admin.
* Manager.

should be able to modify project:

* Icon.
* Color.
* Custom metadata.

Regular project members should only be able to view these settings.

