# Task 16 — Final Cross-Feature Validation

After implementation, validate that the new features work together correctly.

### Access Control

Test:

```text
Admin
Manager
Employee
Different Project Access
No Project Access
Archived Project
Transferred Employee
```

### Project Context

Test:

```text
Single Project
        +
All Projects
        +
Different User Permissions
```

### Resource Flow

Test:

```text
Create Employee
      ↓
Assign Project
      ↓
Transfer Project
      ↓
Notification
      ↓
New Project Access
      ↓
Old Project Access Removed
```

### Data Flow

Verify that:

* Dashboard data is correct.
* Calendar data is correctly scoped.
* Resource counts are accurate.
* All-project aggregation respects permissions.
* Archived projects are excluded from active views.
* Bulk import/export maintains data integrity.
* Project duplication does not create unintended relationships.

### UI Consistency

Verify that:

* New components follow the existing design system.
* Library-based components are reused consistently.
* Loading/error/empty states are implemented.
* Animations do not interfere with usability.
* Responsive behavior works across supported screen sizes.
